{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Biathlon Challenge</strong> is a fast-paced FPS/platformer where style, speed and precision collide. Test your reflexes, creativity, and style through deadly courses, chain trick shots, and stunts to build combos\u2014all while racing the clock for the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize Your Loadout:</strong>  <br>Mix and match your guns and gear to suit your playstyle or challenge yourself with absurd combinations. Each piece affects the way you move, aim, and score.\u00a0Earn new gear from perfect runs, high scores, or by uncovering hidden stashes. Skis? Snowboard? Shotgun? Parachute? <i>Cigar</i>? It\u2019s all fair game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/itemsMix.gif?t=1751090474\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunts + Shooting = Combo Heaven:</strong> <br>Pull off stunts while landing precise shots to build up your score multiplier. The more stylish your run, the higher your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/combo_sm.gif?t=1751090474\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong> <br>Find alternate paths, shortcuts, and secret objectives, better lines, hidden loot, and new scoring opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/jungle_sm.gif?t=1751090474\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578110?t=1751090474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac